Team 11 Project 4 Information

We worked on this project in VScode. Compile the project through VScode using the java extension. Run the Main.java file. 

This project uses the terminal as the interface. It uses number key presses to navigate the main menu, and through the individual menus. 

Below are sample login IDs for testing generated by AI

